            },
            "reviewBody": "I used Stevia instead of the sugar for the dieters in my house, but other than that, made it as directed.\n\nMy mother-in-law loves this. It's a bit sweet for me, and I feel that it needs a touch of fish sauce or soy sauce, which I'll add when I make this again.",
